  <name>Carosello</name>
  <summary>A fast, minimalist image and video viewer for Linux</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Carosello is a fast, minimalist image and video viewer for Linux.
      It opens images and videos from a directory, lets you navigate
      between files with keyboard shortcuts or gestures, and displays
      them with zoom and pan capabilities.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Keyboard-first navigation</li>
      <li>Pinch-to-zoom and scroll wheel zoom</li>
      <li>EXIF orientation support</li>
      <li>Video playback with seek controls</li>
      <li>Auto-hide overlay controls</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.grigio.carosello.desktop</launchable>
